{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics <i>inspired</i> by classic Source\u2122 Engine surfing, SPEEDSHOT challenges players to blend fluid movement with pinpoint aim to master each level. Levels require you to move with speed, efficiency, and control while hitting all targets.  Chain together abilities, ramps, and other environmental boosts while utilizing slow motion to break records. Delve deeper into the &quot;Layers&quot; of the simulation to truly challenge yourself and unlock unique rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong> that the surfing is <i>inspired</i> by classic games, it is not a one to one recreation and has a different learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/c7e12d0c3043b1f915f6525c974a39ad.poster.avif?t=1762057504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/c7e12d0c3043b1f915f6525c974a39ad.webm?t=1762057504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning-fast, replayable FPS speedrunning levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced and accessible movement systems <i>inspired</i> by classic surfing mechanics mixed with modern speedrun games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of aim training and speedrun gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Star, Elite, and other secret objectives to strive for in each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic unlocks such as hand skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards for competitive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect to train with for those high-intensity competitive FPS shooters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/3b5c3f78058dc1c58979af3c9ff61e0c.poster.avif?t=1762057504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/extras/3b5c3f78058dc1c58979af3c9ff61e0c.webm?t=1762057504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984040?t=1762057504","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984040?t=1762057504","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/7cc8c325defc731609889a85a952552c0c5eb46d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762057504","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984040/7cc8c325defc731609889a85a952552c0c5eb46d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762057504","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics <i>inspired</i> by classic Source\u2122 Engine surfing, SPEEDSHOT challenges players to blend fluid movement with pinpoint aim to master each level. Levels require you to move with speed, efficiency, and control while hitting all targets.  Chain together abilities, ramps, and other environmental boosts while utilizing slow motion to break records. Delve deeper into the &quot;Layers&quot; of the simulation to truly challenge yourself and unlock unique rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note</strong> that the surfing is <i>inspired</i> by classic games, it is not a one to one recreation and has a different learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl